(>> Solution to Question 1:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: State and prove Kirchhoff's Current Law \(KCL\) and Kirchhoff's Voltage Law \(KVL\) from fundamental physical conservation principles.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Derivation and Proof of Kirchhoff's Laws:) Tj
T*
(   1. Kirchhoff's Current Law \(KCL\):) Tj
T*
(   - Statement: The algebraic sum of currents entering any electrical node \(or Gaussian closed) Tj
T*
(   boundary\) is identically zero at every instant of time: Sum\(I_k\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Physical Derivation: Follows from the Conservation of Electric Charge and the continuity) Tj
T*
(   equation:) Tj
T*
(   del . J + d\(rho\)/dt = 0.) Tj
T*
(   In lumped circuit theory, electrical nodes have zero physical volume and zero electrostatic) Tj
T*
(   capacitance; therefore, charge cannot accumulate at a point \(d\(q\)/dt = 0\).) Tj
T*
(   Integrating the current density over a closed Gaussian surface enclosing the node yields:) Tj
T*
(   Integral\(J . dA\) = d\(Q_enclosed\)/dt = 0 => Sum\(I_in\) - Sum\(I_out\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   2. Kirchhoff's Voltage Law \(KVL\):) Tj
T*
(   - Statement: The algebraic sum of electrical potential differences \(voltages\) around any closed) Tj
T*
(   loop in a network is zero: Sum\(V_k\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Physical Derivation: Follows from Faraday's Law of Induction under electroquasistatic) Tj
T*
(   \(lumped\) conditions:) Tj
T*
(   Closed_Integral\(E . dl\) = - d\(Phi_B\)/dt.) Tj
T*
(   In lumped DC/low-frequency circuits, time-varying magnetic flux linkage through the loop is) Tj
T*
(   zero \(d\(Phi_B\)/dt = 0\). Thus, the electric field is conservative \(curl E = 0\), allowing the) Tj
T*
(   definition of a single-valued electric scalar potential V such that E = -grad V.) Tj
T*
(   Evaluating the line integral around any closed loop C from node 1 back to node 1 gives:) Tj
T*
(   Closed_Integral\(grad V . dl\) = V1 - V1 = 0 => Sum\(V_k\) = 0.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
