(   derivative to zero:) Tj
T*
(   dP_L / dRL = Vth^2 * [ \(Rth + RL\)^2 * 1 - RL * 2 * \(Rth + RL\) ] / \(Rth + RL\)^4 = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Simplify numerator:) Tj
T*
(   \(Rth + RL\) - 2 * RL = 0 => Rth - RL = 0 => RL = Rth.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify second derivative: d^2 P_L / dRL^2 at RL = Rth is negative \(-Vth^2 / 8*Rth^3 < 0\),) Tj
T*
(   confirming a global maximum.) Tj
T*
(   3. Value of Maximum Power:) Tj
T*
(   P_max = \(Vth^2 * Rth\) / \(Rth + Rth\)^2 = \(Vth^2 * Rth\) / \(4 * Rth^2\) = Vth^2 / \(4 * Rth\).) Tj
T*
(   4. Efficiency Calculation:) Tj
T*
(   - Total power generated by source: P_total = Vth * I_L = Vth * [Vth / \(2*Rth\)] = Vth^2 /) Tj
T*
(   \(2*Rth\).) Tj
T*
(   - Efficiency eta = P_L / P_total = [Vth^2 / \(4*Rth\)] / [Vth^2 / \(2*Rth\)] = 1/2 = 50%.) Tj
T*
(   - At maximum power transfer, 50% of the energy is lost internally inside source resistance Rth) Tj
T*
(   as heat.) Tj
T*
