(   [Problem Statement]: Detail Nodal Analysis methodology, including matrix formulation and the treatment of supernodes.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Nodal Analysis Methodology and Supernodes:) Tj
T*
(   1. Standard Systematic Procedure:) Tj
T*
(   - Select a reference node \(ground, V_ref = 0 V\).) Tj
T*
(   - Label unknown node voltages V1, V2, ..., V_{N-1} at remaining N-1 essential nodes.) Tj
T*
(   - Apply KCL at each non-reference node i: Sum of currents leaving node i = 0.) Tj
