T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Tellegen's Theorem and Topological Energy Conservation:) Tj
T*
(   1. Formal Statement:) Tj
T*
(   In any lumped electrical network of arbitrary complexity containing B branches and N nodes, if) Tj
T*
(   branch voltages v_k and branch currents i_k satisfy KVL and KCL respectively, then:) Tj
T*
(   Sum_{k=1}^B \(v_k * i_k\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   2. Mathematical Proof via Graph Topology:) Tj
T*
