T*
(   Analytical Solution of an Infinite Ladder Network:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Formulation:) Tj
T*
(   - An infinite network consists of identical repeating L-sections: each stage contains a series) Tj
T*
(   resistor R1 and a shunt resistor R2 extending to infinity.) Tj
T*
