T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Bartlett's Bisection Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   1. Statement:) Tj
T*
(   Any physically symmetrical reciprocal two-port network can be bisected into two identical) Tj
T*
(   halves along its axis of symmetry. Its behavior is completely equivalent to a symmetrical) Tj
T*
(   Lattice Network with:) Tj
T*
