(   3. Active Inductor Synthesis:) Tj
T*
(   - If port 2 is terminated with a capacitor: Z_L = 1 / \(s * C\).) Tj
T*
(   - Input impedance: Z_in = r^2 / [1 / \(s * C\)] = s * \(r^2 * C\).) Tj
T*
(   - This matches the impedance of an ideal inductor: Z_in = s * L_eq, where:) Tj
T*
(   L_eq = r^2 * C.) Tj
T*
(   - Eliminates bulky, lossy physical magnetic coils in Integrated Circuit \(IC\) design.) Tj
